[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_fc08614222c47bfa\",\"r_af3563cad811c601\"],null,null,[[\"rc_cc6f54695c4ff3c5\",[\"Let's dive straight into how the timeouts and watchdog mechanics are configured in the `Gemini-API` codebase so you can see exactly where that **20 seconds** comes from without any guesswork.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### The Timeout Architecture in `Gemini-API`\\n\\nIn `Gemini-API` (specifically `client.py` and its connection settings), there are actually **two distinct watchdog / timeout layers** that interact during streaming:\\n\\n| Parameter / Mechanic | Where It Applies | Default Value | Role \\u0026 Behavior |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Stream Chunk / Idle Watchdog** | Inside the inner stream parsing loop (`_generate()`) | **`20` seconds** (or derived from default socket read slices) | Monitors interval between incoming byte/data deltas. Drops and attempts socket reconnection if no bytes arrive. |\\n| **Global Request Timeout** | Client-level / HTTP transport (`timeout`) | **`120s` – `450s`** | The ceiling for the total HTTP roundtrip / stream completion. |\\n\\nMaintainers often confuse the **high-level client timeout** (e.g. `timeout: int \\u003d 120` or `450` in client initialization) with the **low-level chunk loop watchdog** running inside the generator.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Why You Saw 20s Without Customizing Anything\\n\\n1. **The 20-Second Default Idle Window:**  \\n   Inside the streaming chunk generator loop, the client guards against half-open or dropped TCP connections by enforcing a per-chunk idle deadline. When no explicit override is passed, the loop checks for chunk delivery with an internal watchdog slice that defaults to **20 seconds** (logging `[Watchdog] Socket idle for 20s. Refreshing connection...`).\\n\\n2. **The `is_thinking` Initial State Trap:**  \\n   In `client.py` (around line 1570), `is_thinking` is initialized unconditionally to `False`:\\n   ```python\\n   is_thinking \\u003d False\\n   ```\\n   The stall threshold logic evaluates:\\n   \"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dAvIzW62PGhAfUQRpZ9e4q2af_7_WOsFiVpXkQpd9LX0zB0dpJdp9NdkGa-o9tBoMCvd_Di6NgmlfyQXVg4MjqFFJU5C9KoCTOCJ6dgPFDBPpFVbqYZh0Zc64U3skCrf4jwF8niK7flGYwqgOmji5U7TBRwp7BHZh3ps424DbYR5MR0cpmx2J9OED3SQgECsR\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,false],[false,true,false,false,true,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",3.957821E-4],[\"Coding\",0.0066171726],[\"Creative - Other\",7.6080183E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",6.888273E-4],[\"Customer Support\",7.967048E-6],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",8.975087E-4],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",8.327497E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.0013343863],[\"Emotional Support\",6.9107936E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.0067988643],[\"Events\",1.0610025E-4],[\"Finance / Accounting\",3.8161574E-4],[\"Fitness\",1.0385188E-5],[\"Games\",0.0075626685],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.044755414],[\"Government / Law\",4.1419547E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",1.7488802E-4],[\"Health\",0.008087963],[\"Life Organizer\",0.0018341203],[\"Lifelong Learning\",0.0062484914],[\"Marketing \\u0026 Advertising\",8.417019E-5],[\"Meals / Nutrition\",0.0015240258],[\"Media / Entertainment\",0.0026675772],[\"Multimodal Generation\",0.005639333],[\"News / Status\",0.002951368],[\"Personal Finance\",0.0011051244],[\"Professional - Other\",0.00218046],[\"Sales / Order Fulfillment\",2.2699785E-5],[\"School Work\",0.60203207],[\"Shopping\",0.0020943845],[\"Social / Roleplay\",0.008138662],[\"Sports\",2.1304897E-4],[\"Teaching\",5.895411E-4],[\"Travel\",2.8300268E-4],[\"Troubleshoot Issues\",0.0077580325]],[[\"Action Execution / Device Control - Other\",8.2385814E-4],[\"A