hing connection...).\",[[267,277,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[287,343,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The is_thinking Initial State Trap:\",[[4,15,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,35,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"In client.py (around line 1570), is_thinking is initialized unconditionally to False:\",[[3,12,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[33,44,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[79,84,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]],[null,null,null,[\"is_thinking \\u003d False\\n\",\"python\"]],[null,[null,0,\"The stall threshold logic evaluates:\"]],[null,null,null,[\"stall_threshold \\u003d self.timeout if is_thinking else min(self.timeout, self.watchdog_timeout)\\n\",\"python\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Since is_thinking starts as False, the threshold immediately collapses to min(self.timeout, 20) \\u003d 20 seconds.\",[[6,17,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[28,33,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[74,95,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[98,108,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"During extended reasoning (especially on complex chain-of-thought prompts), the server can easily take 25 to 45 seconds before flushing the initial thinking chunk or payload header.\",[[103,119,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The loop reaches 20 seconds of\"]]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/defa